    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For sale by BOC Properties via the iamsold Bidding Platform\r\n\r\nPlease note this property will be offered by online auction (unless sold prior). For auction date and time please visit iamsold.ie. Vendors may decide to accept pre-auction bids so please register your interest with us to avoid disappointment.\r\n\r\nAn exceptional opportunity to acquire a charming Town property currently comprising two self-contained residential units, ideally situated in the heart of Toomevara Village, measuring approximately 97.45 mtr sq (1042 sq ft) in total.\r\n\r\nOccupying a prime position on Church Street, adjacent to the Town Hall — widely regarded as the commercial hub of Toomevara — this well-maintained property is presented in excellent condition and is ready for immediate occupation with no further expenditure required.\r\n\r\nGround Floor Apartment\r\nThe ground floor unit benefits from its own private front entrance and access to a small rear garden. Accommodation comprises:\r\nSpacious sitting room, Living room, Fully fitted kitchen, Bathroom,One generous bedroom\r\n\r\nFirst Floor Apartment\r\nThe first-floor apartment also enjoys its own independent access and comprises: Open-plan kitchen/dining area, Bathroom, Two spacious bedrooms\r\n\r\nPrime Village Location\r\nIdeally located in the centre of Toomevara, the property is within walking distance of a wide range of local amenities, including shops, cafés, schools, sporting facilities, and healthcare services.\r\n\r\nToomevara is strategically positioned between Nenagh and Roscrea and is within easy reach of the M7 Motorway, providing excellent connectivity to Limerick, Dublin, and beyond. This makes the property an attractive proposition for both owner-occupiers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nViewing is strictly by appointment.\r\n\r\nBer Rating C3\r\nBer number 119369254\r\n\r\nThe particulars stated are for guideline purposes only, BOC Properties OR iamsold will not be held responsible for any inaccuracies.\r\n\r\nTO VIEW OR MAKE A BID contact BOC Properties or iamsold, www.iamsold.ie\r\n\r\nStarting Bid and Reserve Price\r\n*Please note all properties are subject to a starting bid price and an undisclosed reserve. Both the starting bid and reserve price may be subject to change. Terms and conditions apply to the sale, which is powered by iamsold.\r\n\r\nAuctioneer's Comments\r\nThis property is offered for sale by unconditional auction. The successful bidder is required to pay a 10% deposit and contracts are signed immediately on acceptance of a bid. Please note this property is subject to an undisclosed reserve price. Terms and conditions apply to this sale.\r\n\r\nBuilding Energy Rating (BERs)"
      },
